@startuml SSD_UC008_TCP_Command_Interface
hide footbox
title SSD - UC-008 TCP 명령 인터페이스로 컨트롤러 구동 및 상태 조회

actor "시뮬레이터/\n시스템 테스트\n클라이언트" as Client
participant "rvc_app" as System

Client -> System: connect()
activate System

Client -> System: command line

alt command line exceeds 1024 bytes
    System --> Client: ERR INVALID_ARGUMENT
    System -> Client: close session
else invalid command
    System --> Client: ERR UNKNOWN_COMMAND or ERR INVALID_ARGUMENT
else sensor input command
    System --> Client: OK ...
    note right of System: UC-001~UC-007 중 해당 자동 청소 흐름 실행
else GET_STATE
    System --> Client: OK STATE MOVEMENT=... DIRECTION=... FRONT=... BACK=... DUST=... DRIVE=... CLEANING_POWER=...
else RESET
    System --> Client: OK RESET
else QUIT
    System --> Client: OK BYE
    System -> Client: close session
end

deactivate System
@enduml
